# Host desk (BHD)

The time-limited demo-invite feature is **host desk**, not “hosted review” or a generic share page.

- **BHD** / **build BHD** / **build host desk** = implement or extend the host desk (same pattern as CIT24 / TP24).
- Desk lives at public `/host`. It mints a signed `/review/{token}` URL. Expiry days are adjustable (default 3, range 1–30). The token works on another device until it expires.
- Engine: `lib/invite.ts`. Do not put the host PIN on the public login page.
- In UI and copy, call it **Host desk**. Keep 7L-only minting vs guest review-link entry distinct.
- Default demo door is **in-house** (Aetherion). Advisor is optional.
